# @s = rig anchor (the boss body, on the floor under the ring axis), positioned and rotated where the device
# should appear. Kills old parts, summons the 29 parts in the rest pose of the stored form (fgRigForm, cruise by
# default), queues that form's hold clip and re-applies the stored look and crack stage.
function rlk:mboss/fieldgen/rig/init
function rlk:mboss/fieldgen/rig/kill
execute unless score @s fgRigForm matches 1..7 run scoreboard players set @s fgRigForm 2
execute unless score @s fgRigLook matches 0..4 run scoreboard players set @s fgRigLook 0
execute unless score @s fgRigCrack matches 0..4 run scoreboard players set @s fgRigCrack 0
